---
description: The kit's rule for GitHub Actions workflows
globs: .github/workflows/*.yml,.github/workflows/*.yaml
alwaysApply: false
---
Before you change a file this rule is attached to, read @.kit/rules/workflows.md and follow it. The kit places it there
and keeps it current, so it is read, never edited. A file this rule governs by its content rather than its name, such
as a script with no suffix, is named by `kit context <path>`. How the kit works is in .kit/1st.md.
